{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用回溯维护当前组合与剩余目标，并规定下一次只能从当前下标及其右侧选择候选数。选择后仍从原下标继续，因此同一数字可以重复使用；剩余值为 0 时记录答案，剩余值小于 0 或候选数过大时回退。这个下标约束会让组合保持固定顺序，从而避免把 [2,2,3] 和 [3,2,2] 重复计数。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>组合总和可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:15px}body{padding:24px}main{width:100%;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto}.panel{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:18px}h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;color:#fff}p{margin:7px 0;line-height:1.65}.mono,.num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.candidates,.path,.answers{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}.cell{min-width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;text-align:center;transition:.35s}.cell .num{display:block;font-size:14px;color:#ddd}.cell .label{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:10px;color:#9d9d9d}.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.active .num{color:#fff}.state-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px}.state{padding:14px;border:1px solid #444;border-radius:8px;background:#2a2a2a}.state span{display:block;color:#9d9d9d;margin-bottom:7px}.state strong{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:20px;color:#3794ff}.step{min-height:52px;padding:13px 15px;border-left:4px solid #3794ff;background:#202d3d;line-height:1.7;margin-top:16px}.token{padding:9px 13px;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:7px;background:#2d2d30;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.35s}.token.new{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.answer{padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:7px;background:#2d2d30;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;opacity:.38;transition:.35s}.answer.found{opacity:1;background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.rule{color:#b8b8b8}.accent{color:#3794ff}.bar{height:7px;background:#333;border-radius:6px;margin-top:16px}.progress{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;border-radius:6px;transition:width .35s}\n/* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}p{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:4px 0!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.cell{min-width:38px!important;min-height:48px!important;padding:4px 6px!important;border-radius:4px!important}.cell .num{font-size:14px!important}.cell .label{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.state-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:6px!important}.state{padding:8px 10px!important}.state strong{font-size:13px!important}.step{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;min-height:auto!important}.token,.answer{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:12px!important}.bar{height:3px!important;margin-top:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>示例 1：回溯搜索</h1>\n<p class=\"mono\">candidates = [2,3,6,7]，target = 7</p>\n<p class=\"rule\">每层只考察“当前下标及其右侧”的数字；选中某数后仍可停留在该下标，所以它能被重复选择。</p>\n<div class=\"candidates\" id=\"candidates\">\n<div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"label\">下标 0</span></div>\n<div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"label\">下标 1</span></div>\n<div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"label\">下标 2</span></div>\n<div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"label\">下标 3</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"state-grid\">\n<div class=\"state\"><span>当前组合</span><strong id=\"pathText\">[]</strong></div>\n<div class=\"state\"><span>剩余目标</span><strong id=\"remain\">7</strong></div>\n<div class=\"state\"><span>允许选择的起点</span><strong id=\"start\">下标 0</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"path\" id=\"path\"></div>\n<div class=\"step\" id=\"step\">从空组合开始搜索。</div>\n<div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<p>已经找到的组合</p>\n<div class=\"answers\">\n<div class=\"answer\" id=\"answerA\">[2, 2, 3]</div>\n<div class=\"answer\" id=\"answerB\">[7]</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rule\">遇到 <span class=\"accent\">剩余目标 = 0</span> 就收集当前组合；分支不成立时撤销最后一次选择，再尝试右侧候选数。</p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst candidates=[2,3,6,7],target=7,frames=[],answers=[],currentPath=[];\nfunction snapshot(r,s,a,t){frames.push({p:currentPath.slice(),r,s,a,t,foundCount:answers.length});}\nsnapshot(target,0,-1,'从空组合开始, 候选数已升序排列.');\nfunction search(start,remain){if(remain===0){answers.push(currentPath.slice());snapshot(remain,start,-1,'剩余目标为 0, 收集 ['+currentPath.join(', ')+'].');return;}\n for(let j=start;j<candidates.length;j++){const value=candidates[j];if(value>remain){snapshot(remain,start,j,value+' > 剩余 '+remain+', 后续候选数更大, 剪枝并返回.');break;}\n currentPath.push(value);snapshot(remain-value,j,j,'选择 '+value+', 下一层仍从下标 '+j+' 开始, 允许重复使用.');search(j,remain-value);currentPath.pop();snapshot(remain,start,j,'撤销 '+value+', 恢复当前组合和剩余目标, 继续尝试右侧候选数.');}}\nsearch(0,target);snapshot(target,0,-1,'搜索完成: 共 '+answers.length+' 个组合, 没有排列重复.');\nframes.forEach((frame,i)=>frame.f=(i+1)/frames.length*100);\n\nconst cells=[...document.querySelectorAll('.cell')],path=document.getElementById('path'),pathText=document.getElementById('pathText'),remain=document.getElementById('remain'),start=document.getElementById('start'),step=document.getElementById('step'),progress=document.getElementById('progress'),aa=document.getElementById('answerA'),ab=document.getElementById('answerB');\nlet i=0;\nfunction draw(x){cells.forEach((c,j)=>c.classList.toggle('active',j===x.a));path.innerHTML=x.p.map((n,j)=>`<div class=\"token ${j===x.p.length-1?'new':''}\">${n}</div>`).join('');pathText.textContent='['+x.p.join(', ')+']';remain.textContent=x.r;start.textContent='下标 '+x.s;step.textContent=x.t;progress.style.width=x.f+'%';aa.classList.toggle('found',x.foundCount>=1);ab.classList.toggle('found',x.foundCount>=2)}\nfunction next(){draw(frames[i]);i=(i+1)%frames.length}next();setInterval(next,1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
